  "inShort": "From the devlog and available evidence, the checkpoint is at risk. The reference tasks are done, but playable progress is unknown because no build or playtest notes were shown. Mia has not confirmed work for two weeks, so co-op sailing cannot rely on her availability.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sa101am4gz8x0m11qfx",
      "text": "The public repository matches the task: Godot demos, an MIT license and import instructions. It supplies a starting point, not evidence of the playable slice."
