      "itemId": "cmvu35sd201an4gz82vgs6mq3",
      "text": "The animated reference video remains done. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, but the video was not watched. The animated style reference could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sg701aq4gz890icklg1",
      "text": "The reference article matches the task and explains playtesting methods. It does not establish that five players tested this game."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog claims five players tried the tide loop. That would advance the checkpoint goal, but neither the playtest document nor a playable build is available to verify it.",
    "The mountain photograph and Big Buck Bunny preview do not show two islands, a tide loop or co-op sailing. They leave the claimed playable progress unverified."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Where is the playable build showing two islands, the tide loop and co-op sailing?",
    "Where are the five players’ results, including what each completed, where they got stuck and whether they tested co-op?"
  ]
}

